      "cooked": "<p>A short update pre surgery</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/surgery-sode\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/surgery-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1a6627793cbae4ecf7bc1ded6dbf80eff1ff26ff.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/surgery-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Surgery-Sode!!!</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It's finally here! The long-awaited surgery-sode! That's right, not much of an episode today, because Christopher just had spine surgery and is recovering. How's recovery going? I'm sure we'll find out soon! Bear with us until then! (AAAAH!! The bear...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
